==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
*5 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Spacefish Jones]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**20 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**1 [[Calamary]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage has almost no pushing power. As long as you have a way to deal damage to Calamary, you'll win.

